From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joinery Build <build@joinery.invalid>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 02:03:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(editor): steady start screens and project setup

Equal-height empty-state actions, a flush agent row with a Change link, a faint-accent disabled primary, aligned app blurbs, Godot shown as always included, a footer rule with the page kept inside its column, a steady header and red bar on failure, a spinning running step, a cancellable setup and Create plain project as the primary after an app-list failure.

Joinery-only start screen and setup flow, not intended for upstream.
